{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53023","headline":"呈史君（名岩） 二 · 杨旬","name":"呈史君（名岩） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人道公门不可入，我道公门好修行。\n若使曲直无颠倒，脚踏莲花步步生。\n（《卐续藏经》本宋佚名《金刚经感应传》）（按：《金刚经感应传》云杨旬常持《金刚》、《般若》，感动上天，其子杨椿省试得九十六名，殿试魁天下。\n所述科举之事，显爲宋制，疑诗亦爲宋人依托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨旬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}